        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leni Riefenstahl, Annie Sundberg, Ricki Stern, Naomi Wolf, Karl Attenberger\n- Films: Triumph of the Will, The End of America, Lowlands\n- Topics: propaganda films, documentary films, film adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- In 1935, Leni Riefenstahl directed, produced, edited, and co-wrote the German propaganda film \"Triumph of the Will.\"\n- In 1935, Karl Attenberger worked with Leni Riefenstahl on the propaganda documentary \"Triumph of the Will.\"\n- Leni Riefenstahl later directed and starred in the sound film \"Lowlands.\"\n- Naomi Wolf wrote the 2007 book that \"The End of America\" was adapted from.\n- In 2008, Annie Sundberg and Ricki Stern directed the documentary film \"The End of America.\"",
